{"items":[{"review_id":"232685697","text":"Just learning the game, people seem unhappy, dunno exactly stuff about that.\nCombat feels scuffed\nPerformance feels weird already\nUI is ass but eh, you get used to it\nSalvaging i like\nSupposedly game has some stupid supernatural plotline, feels unecessary, just wanna salvage, trade and be","text_zh":"刚在学这个游戏，人们似乎不太高兴，不太清楚具体是怎么回事。\n战斗感觉有点拉胯\n性能感觉已经有点怪了\nUI很烂但呃，你会习惯的\n打捞我喜欢\n据说游戏有一些愚蠢的超自然剧情线，感觉没必要，只想打捞、交易、做自己","translation_status":"ready","recommended":false,"created_at":"2026-08-12T21:36:50+00:00","language":"english","observations":[{"category":"gameplay_mechanics","description":"战斗手感有问题","evidence":"Combat feels scuffed","claim":"complaint","change_evidence":"","object":"combat","symptom":"combat_feels_scuffed","observation_id":"ae3f64751517e5a8b01855c0","review_id":"232685697","review_version_id":"fc9178969cd1e634fcfe31c1","outside_definition":false,"issue_id":"bbc1d0fa8d87739f83df4ce0","evidence_zh":"战斗感觉拉胯","change_evidence_zh":null,"translation_status":"ready","change_translation_status":"pending"}],"updated_at":"2026-08-12T21:36:50+00:00","review_version_id":"fc9178969cd1e634fcfe31c1","snapshot_id":"bf425e9d18912e5dd8af0055","observed_at":"2026-09-23T12:57:11.033975+00:00"}],"total":1,"offset":0,"source_url":"https://store.steampowered.com/appreviews/1022980","snapshot_id":"bf425e9d18912e5dd8af0055","observed_at":"2026-09-23T12:57:11.033975+00:00"}